{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Departure of Darkness is a classic late-90's style survival-horror game set in a fictional airport in the year 2005.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Emma Reed, arriving at the terminal to pick up her younger brother Jake. With the airport in lockdown and no help coming, Emma must navigate the chaos, find Jake, and lead a growing group of survivors to safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay quiet as enemies react to sound. Every step, shot, or scream could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What Awaits You:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic survival-horror gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Early 2000s nostalgic visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A detailed, fictional airport setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wide variety of enemies and locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stealth-based survival and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parasite\u2019s can hear you, don\u2019t make a sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Branching puzzle solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead survivors to safety</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your final boarding call awaits.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579980?t=1747125153","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579980?t=1747125153","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/5e33b995f4629debfad9382ebfb4d7c31d0612c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747125153","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/5e33b995f4629debfad9382ebfb4d7c31d0612c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747125153","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descripti